item.description:
Some of the biggest advances in AI have come from solving many problems together, rather than training specialized systems for individual tasks.
@svlevine (@physical_int) talks about the same principle for robotics. Make the problem bigger. https://t.co/1GxLuuNmu3
Bio: General Partner @SPC, Co-Founder @Bevel_Health | Ex: Early Eng @facebook, CTO @Dropbox, Board @Flipkart | Optimist, Builder, Dad ❤️ 35 🔁 3
